  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/e586b38e-f4f8-4238-918b-b12015b563b4-image.png\" style=\"width: 146px; height: 197px;\" /></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>V</mi><mo mathvariant=\"italic\">=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">M</mi></mrow><msub><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mi></msub></mfrac></msqrt></math></p><p>From angular momentum conversation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mfenced><mrow><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><mi>V</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>G</mi><mi>M</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msubsup><mi>V</mi><mi>min</mi><mn>2</mn></msubsup></math></p><p>From angular momentum conversation</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msqrt><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac></msqrt><msub><mi>VR</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mi>min</mi></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi>max</mi></msub></math></p><p>Eliminating&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mtext>min&#160;</mtext></msub></math> from equation (i) and (ii) we get</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>R</mi><mi>max</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></msub></math></p>",
